Subject: [PATCH 113/114] media: qcom: hotdog-popup: match stock motor cadence

---
 .../boot/dts/qcom/sm8150-oneplus-hotdog.dts   |  16 +-
 drivers/media/platform/qcom/Kconfig           |   2 +-
 .../media/platform/qcom/hotdog-popup-motor.c  | 282 +++++++++++-------
 3 files changed, 187 insertions(+), 113 deletions(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8150-oneplus-hotdog.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8150-oneplus-hotdog.dts
index dc111f9ab..bc5a63ed3 100644
